"“USB 调试”和“无线调试”是两个开关。已在镜连配对过的手机，请选择“发现手机”；只有首次使用或授权被撤销时才需要重新配对。" = "USB debugging and Wireless debugging are separate switches. If this phone was already paired in MirrorLink, choose Discover Phones. Pair again only for first use or if authorization was revoked.";
