"无法访问手机的无线调试端口。请在 macOS“系统设置 → 隐私与安全 → 本地网络”中允许 MirrorLink，并检查 VPN、访客网络或设备隔离；权限已开启仍失败时，可导出问题反馈以检查 ADB 后台状态。" = "The phone's wireless debugging port is unreachable. Allow MirrorLink in macOS System Settings → Privacy & Security → Local Network, and check VPN, guest network or device isolation settings. If access is already allowed, export a feedback package to help diagnose the ADB background service.";
