"ADB 返回已连接，但尚未确认这台手机。请检查地址并重试；不会自动选择其他手机投屏。" = "ADB reported a connection, but this phone could not be verified. Check the address and try again. MirrorLink will not automatically select another phone.";
"Developer ID 签名构建。公证结果以随安装包提供的发行清单及 macOS 安全验证为准。" = "Developer ID signed build. Refer to the release manifest supplied with the installer and macOS security verification for notarization status.";
