"USB 连接需允许调试" = "Authorize USB debugging on your phone";
"[%@] 已收到手机画面，投屏窗口已就绪。" = "[%@] Phone video received. The mirroring window is ready.";
"[%@] 投屏窗口已关闭。" = "[%@] Mirroring window closed.";
"[%@] 画质请求：%@。禁止出错后自动降低分辨率。" = "[%@] Requested quality: %@. Automatic resolution reduction on error is disabled.";
"上次检查：%@" = "Last checked: %@";
"主动限制画面长边到 1920 像素以减轻负载，适合带宽不足、多设备或编码失败时使用。" = "Limits the longer edge to 1920 pixels to reduce load. Useful for limited bandwidth, multiple devices, or encoder failures.";
"二维码已过期。点击“生成新二维码”后重新扫描。" = "The QR code has expired. Click “Generate New QR Code” and scan again.";
"二维码已过期，已停止自动连接。若手机已显示配对成功，可在“发现手机”中连接；否则请生成新二维码。" = "The QR code expired, so automatic connection stopped. If the phone shows successful pairing, connect from Discover Phones. Otherwise, generate a new QR code.";
"二维码已过期，请生成新二维码。" = "The QR code expired. Generate a new one.";
"二维码无法生成，请重试或使用手动连接。" = "Could not generate a QR code. Try again or use manual setup.";
"二维码是本次临时授权凭据，请勿分享或截图转发。关闭此窗口或切换方式会停止发现和自动投屏；已完成的手机授权不会因此撤销。" = "This QR code is a temporary authorization credential. Do not share it or send screenshots. Closing this window or changing methods stops discovery and automatic mirroring, but does not revoke authorization already granted by your phone.";
"仅在可信网络使用。若系统询问，请允许镜连访问本地网络；访客 Wi-Fi、设备隔离或 VPN 可能阻止发现。用完可在手机关闭无线调试。发现手机不代表获得授权。" = "Use only on trusted networks. Allow MirrorLink to access the local network if macOS asks. Guest Wi-Fi, device isolation, or a VPN may prevent discovery. You can turn off wireless debugging when finished. Discovering a phone does not authorize access.";
"仅用于本次配对" = "For this pairing only";
"仍有 %@ 台手机正在启动或投屏。退出或安装更新会关闭镜连启动的投屏窗口，不会清除手机数据。" = "Active or starting mirroring sessions: %@. Quitting or installing an update will close the mirroring windows started by MirrorLink. Phone data will be preserved.";
