"保留手机原生细节，最高 60 fps；适合滑动和动态内容，手机与网络负载更高。" = "Preserves the phone's native resolution at up to 60 fps for smoother scrolling and motion, with higher phone and network load.";
"保留手机原生细节，限制到最高 30 fps，优先文字清晰与持续使用。" = "Preserves the phone's native resolution at up to 30 fps, prioritizing clear text and sustained use.";
