"免费社区版：更新包和更新清单使用镜连自己的签名校验，应用使用 ad-hoc 完整性签名，未获 Apple 公证。首次打开可能需要在“系统设置 → 隐私与安全”中手动允许；受管理的 Mac 可能不允许安装。请仅从镜连官方 GitHub 下载，不要关闭系统安全检查。" = "Free community edition. Update packages and feeds use MirrorLink’s own signature verification. The app uses an ad-hoc integrity signature and is not notarized by Apple. The first launch may require approval in System Settings → Privacy & Security; managed Macs may not allow installation. Download only from MirrorLink’s official GitHub repository and keep system security checks enabled.";
