"开发体验版：仅使用本地 ad-hoc 签名，未通过 Developer ID 签名与 Apple 公证。下载到其他 Mac 可能被系统拦截，不属于正式公开发行版。" = "Development preview. This build uses only a local ad-hoc signature, without Developer ID signing or Apple notarization. macOS may block it on another Mac. It is not a public release.";
