"手机不支持扫码，或网络无法发现设备时，可使用此兼容入口。" = "Use manual setup if your phone does not support QR pairing or cannot be discovered on the network.";
"手机与 Mac 连接同一 Wi-Fi。在手机“开发者选项”中开启“无线调试”（Android 11+）。首次扫码授权，以后可发现并连接。" = "Connect your phone and Mac to the same Wi-Fi network. Enable Wireless debugging in your phone’s Developer options (Android 11+). Pair by QR code the first time; afterward, discover and connect to the phone.";
"手机尚未就绪。请解锁手机，确认无线调试已开启；若授权已失效，请重新配对。" = "The phone is not ready. Unlock it and make sure Wireless debugging is enabled. Pair again if authorization has expired.";
"手机编码器调整了画面参数，请以实际画面尺寸为准；若清晰度不足，可重新投屏或改用兼容档。" = "The phone's encoder adjusted the video settings. Check the actual video size. If clarity is insufficient, restart mirroring or choose Compatibility mode.";
