"支持 macOS 13 或更高版本，可同时投屏多台通过 USB 授权或无线调试配对的 Android 手机。每台手机独立显示，可分别开始、重试、重新投屏和停止；退出镜连会停止本应用启动的全部投屏。实际并行能力取决于手机与 Mac 性能，以及 USB 或 Wi-Fi 连接。" = "Requires macOS 13 or later. Mirror multiple Android phones authorized by USB or paired with wireless debugging. Each phone has its own window and can be started, retried, restarted, or stopped independently. Quitting MirrorLink stops all sessions started by this app. Concurrent performance depends on the phones, Mac, and USB or Wi-Fi connection.";
"收到的画面尺寸已由 %@ 减小为 %@。请检查手机显示设置或重新投屏。" = "The received video size decreased from %@ to %@. Check the phone's display settings or restart mirroring.";
